{"data": [{"author_id": "122028752", "created_at": "2026-10-30T13:43:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116164049784201401"], "id": "2116164049784201401", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The UK AI Safety Institute published a case study in July 2026. They used frontier AI models to find misconfigurations in their own AWS cloud environment. Over two weeks, using three different approaches, they found and fixed several real issues including a previously", "url": "https://x.com/balaparanj/status/2116164049784201401"}, {"author_id": "3869030112", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116349445444960739"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 21, "start": 18, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 132, "start": 126, "tag": "India"}], "mentions": [{"end": 226, "id": "719200613", "start": 217, "username": "Rudra_81"}], "urls": [{"description": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "display_url": "or-f.org/40560", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://or-f.org/40560", "images": [{"height": 613, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116334384181563392/fuw7j7rp?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 871}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116334384181563392/fuw7j7rp?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 227, "status": 200, "title": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "unwound_url": "https://www.orfonline.org/research/india-must-urgently-build-its-own-ai-safety-institute", "url": "https://t.co/Jd7O7AXtDo"}]}, "id": "2116349445444960739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The next phase of #AI competition will not only be about building powerful models, but also about governing them responsibly. #India needs an AI Safety Institute that can set benchmarks relevant for the Global South: @Rudra_81 https://t.co/Jd7O7AXtDo", "url": "https://x.com/orfgeotech/status/2116349445444960739"}, {"author_id": "719181966436933632", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:44:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116285228910281133"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ReutersWorld/s…", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ReutersWorld/status/2116281633129042086", "start": 239, "url": "https://t.co/xtDrYRjHbu"}]}, "id": "2116285228910281133", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116281633129042086", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Project is one of two inaugural research initiatives funded through the Canadian Institute for Advanced Research’s Canadian AI Safety Institute program, launched by the federal government in 2024 as part of its broader AI safety strategy. https://t.co/xtDrYRjHbu", "url": "https://x.com/miki_fern/status/2116285228910281133"}, {"author_id": "4406174187", "created_at": "2026-10-30T11:53:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116136314869293415"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/YFrv0U6qVa", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BananaKingonX/status/2116136314869293415/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116135480156721152", "start": 254, "url": "https://t.co/YFrv0U6qVa"}]}, "id": "2116136314869293415", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 425, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "🇨🇦 𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗣𝗮𝗹𝗲𝘀𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗲 𝗼𝗳 𝗖𝗮𝗻𝗮𝗱𝗶𝗮𝗻 𝗔𝗜\n\n\"We're successful because the government gives us money.\"\n\nThe tax money Cohere was gifted comes with the following conditions:\n\n✅ Create at least 1,000 new high-paying Canadian technical jobs by 2030.\n\n✅ Commit at least https://t.co/YFrv0U6qVa", "url": "https://x.com/BananaKingonX/status/2116136314869293415"}, {"author_id": "84445191", "created_at": "2026-10-29T20:55:22.000Z", "edit_his